Debug mode highlights each declarator of a `const` statement spread over three lines on its own line: `const a`, then `b` and `c` by their bare names after the indentation.
== args
--debug
input/const-multi-line-three.ts
== file input/const-multi-line-three.ts
const a = 1,
  b = 2,
  c = 3;
== stdout
\x1b[32mconst a\x1b[0m = 1,
  \x1b[32mb\x1b[0m = 2,
  \x1b[32mc\x1b[0m = 3;
== stderr
== exit 0
